afk.msg_ladder_stop	{"v":"AFK: your turn ended on a question the owner cannot answer. Do not ask: decide from the plan and context, or ask the advisor; only a destructive/irreversible or work-wrecking choice not implied by the plan is parked as `- [ ] NEEDS OWNER: <question>` in your progress file. Then continue the other parts of the plan."}
