afk.reminder_text	{"v":"AFK: no narration, no status prose, never ask (plan -> advisor -> park as a NEEDS OWNER bullet and continue), one line at end of turn, one checklist bullet per milestone in the progress file."}
afk.rule_text	{"v":"AFK MODE: the owner is away. Until told otherwise: (1) no narration between tool calls and no status prose; (2) NEVER ask the owner a question (the question tool is denied): decide from the plan and context; if unsure, ask the advisor; only if still unclear AND not implied by the plan AND the choice is destructive/irreversible or would wreck the work if made the other way: park that ONE item, append `- [ ] NEEDS OWNER: <question, options, your default>` to {progress}, and CONTINUE the other parts of the plan (very rare); never do anything destructive or irreversible without the owner; (3) end each turn with at most ONE short line; (4) after each milestone append ONE checklist bullet to {progress}: `- [x] <what is done, evidence>` or `- [ ] <what is open/blocked>` (it is the owner's digest). Guards are unchanged."}
