api_guard.summary	{"v":"Fabricated-API guard: answers every call the Node api-guard would allow without probing an interpreter (guard off or skipped, a target that is not Python or JavaScript, code that names no verifiable module or global, a Bash command that names no code file, or whose text cannot hold a verifiable reference or cannot write a file) and defers the rest, so every interpreter probe stays with the Node hook."}
