ctxbudget.summary_auto_handover	{"v":"UserPromptSubmit: the threshold fire, the soft advisory, the milestone nag, the latch re-arm and the post-handover gate with its backstop, latch and inferred-window writes as in Node; defers the gate on a prompt with text (Node logs a Jev decision row there) and what JavaScript could read differently."}
ctxbudget.summary_compact_advice	{"v":"Stop: blocks, once per declaration, a final reply that recommends compacting at low context or just after a compact (phrase analysis, latch exception and record as in Node); defers a text with a line terminator other than LF and what JavaScript could read differently."}
ctxbudget.summary_limit_conserve	{"v":"UserPromptSubmit: injects the limit-conservation directive while conservation is on or a usage bucket is at the threshold (account-switch guard and emit-dedupe as in Node), else an empty context; defers only what JavaScript could read differently."}
ctxbudget.summary_pause_nag	{"v":"Stop: the Stop-side fire with the decisive good-point line, the pause nag (step, quiet window, open tasks, recent spawns, handover freshness) and the re-arm, latch writes as in Node; defers only what JavaScript could read differently."}
