devswarm_gates.cg_inbox_durable_unknown	{"v":"Inbox: your unread count is UNKNOWN ({reason}): the store could not be read, so this gate cannot prove your inbox is empty. Run `{cli} inbox count {id}` and read any mail BEFORE you stop. "}
devswarm_gates.cg_inbox_native_only	{"v":"Inbox: the native `hivecontrol workspace message-count` probe failed or timed out, so this gate cannot prove your native queue is empty (your mesh inbox and report are fine). Try `{cli} inbox pull {id}` once and handle any mail; if it fails the same way the native channel is unreachable from here, so you may stop — this warning will not repeat."}
devswarm_gates.cg_inbox_native_unknown	{"v":"Inbox: your NATIVE unread count is UNKNOWN (the `hivecontrol workspace message-count` probe failed or timed out), so this gate cannot prove your native queue is empty. Run `{cli} inbox pull {id}` and handle any mail BEFORE you stop. "}
devswarm_gates.cg_inbox_pending	{"v":"Inbox: you have unpulled/unread parent message(s): run `{cli} inbox pull {id}` (or `inbox read` if already pulled), then `inbox ack` once addressed — BEFORE you stop. "}
