devswarm_prompt.child_summary	{"v":"DevSwarm child prompt hook: answers the silent cases (not a child workspace, DevSwarm inactive, switch off, judge child) and every active child turn in the engine: the heartbeat (with the git push state in a checkout), the descriptor and registry row under the workspace lock, the fixed reminder block through emit-dedupe, the step plan, unread parent mail and the archive request. An archived workspace, an ingest daemon that is not healthy, mesh-direct unread mail, a store Node would first create and the other rare states defer to the Node hook."}
