devswarm_prompt.parent_summary	{"v":"DevSwarm Primary prompt hook: answers the silent cases (not a Primary, DevSwarm inactive, switch off, judge child) and every active Primary turn, in a git checkout or not, in the engine: the communication-override reminder through emit-dedupe, the ingest-daemon banners and summary refresh, the mailbox-wake line, the session-drift and maintainer-notice feeds, the live workspace table of the project's summary with its nudges, archive recommendation and not-draining / stale-build labels, the orphaned-mesh, stale-registry and broadcast segments, the Primary's own inbox with the questions it was asked, the screenshot-sync ask and the parked supervisor escalations. A seat conflict still owed its repeat, a setting of the hook set anywhere, an unseen maintainer notice, a row the supervisor's auto-archive owns and the other rare states defer to the Node hook, each cause logged as parent-inbox-defer."}
