diagnostics.shed_never	{"v":{"advisor-guard":"Enforcement: its PostToolUse/PostToolUseFailure halves arm and disarm the retry rule its PreToolUse half blocks on; shedding them skips or strands that block.","afk-mode":"Enforcement: its prompt half handles the owner's typed afk/back and records owner presence, its post/start halves inject the AFK rule; shedding it leaves AFK on (questions denied) or the rule unsaid.","agent-reminders":"Delivers the stale-agent nudges and reminders the tracker queued.","auto-handover":"Triggers the handover at the context threshold.","codex-quota-detect":"Records the quota state later routing reads.","coordinator-work-guard":"PostToolUse half records coordinator work the PreToolUse half judges.","devswarm-child-drain":"Drains a child's mail; skipping it strands messages.","devswarm-child-gate":"Workspace child gate (Stop guard; listed so the audit counts it as essential).","devswarm-child-role":"Seats a child in its role.","devswarm-child-turn":"Per-turn child bookkeeping.","devswarm-parent-inbox":"Delivers a parent's inbox.","devswarm-parent-reply-tracker":"Records parent replies; the parent gate decides from them.","devswarm-rt-advisory":"Workspace runtime notice a Primary acts on.","dispatch-tier":"Records the dispatch tier later guards read.","emit-dedupe-reset":"Resets the emit dedupe state of a session.","git-audit":"PostToolUse audit of git calls (git-guard:audit); later git guards read it.","handover-resume":"Restores a session from its handover.","merge-side-pick":"PostToolUse recorder: the merge guard reads what it recorded.","output-verify-guard":"PostToolUse recorder of tool output the verify guard checks later.","precompact-snapshot":"Takes the pre-compaction snapshot.","progress-prune":"Prunes progress files; state upkeep.","repair-on-reload":"Repairs state after a reload.","session-end-mcp-reaper":"Cleans up the session's MCP processes.","task-lifecycle-log":"Task create/complete log other guards read.","task-tracker":"Keeps the task state the Stop guards read.","tasklist-guard":"Task-list Stop guard (a guard event is never shed; listed so the audit counts it as essential).","verify-first":"Per-prompt verify-first reminder (#312: essential, shed 4x in the audit window).","verify-first-full":"Session-start verify-first protocol text.","verify-first-orch":"Session-start orchestration reminder.","verify-first-orch-codex":"Codex session-start orchestration reminder.","verify-first-subagent":"Verify-first text a subagent starts with."}}
