git_audit.msg_published	{"v":{"instead":"stop: do not push to {remotes} again and do not amend or rebase these commits. Report the hashes ({hits}) and the remote refs ({remotes}) to the owner and wait for their decision on the published history. Commit without credit from now on.","override":"turn off guards.gitCommitAudit, only after you checked the message.","what":"the commit(s) just written carry AI credit ({hits}) and are already on a remote ({remotes}).","why":"Commits in this setup carry no AI credit. The credit is published: an amend or a new commit leaves it in the remote's history, and rewriting published history is the owner's decision, not the agent's."}}
