guardkit.brief_instead	{"v":{"burn-breaker":"Save working changes in a commit, or write your report and stop.","command-guard":"hand the command to a helper agent.","edit-guard":"Hand the edit to a helper agent."}}
guardkit.brief_what	{"v":{"burn-breaker":"this tool call is paused after work with no recorded outcome.","command-guard":"this heavy command was stopped in the main thread.","edit-guard":"the main agent cannot make this project edit."}}
guardkit.brief_why	{"v":{"burn-breaker":"Further work needs a saved outcome.","command-guard":"Long output would crowd the main conversation.","edit-guard":"A helper makes the edit and reports back."}}
