session_gates.key_binding_note	{"v":"your generic Jev key (jev_api_key / jev.keyFile) is bound to {vendor} and is NOT sent to typesafe. Enter a typesafe key (jev-setup.js set-key --transport typesafe, or jev_typesafe_api_key in the plugin's options screen), or, if that generic key is a typesafe key, bind it: jev-setup.js bind-generic-key --vendor typesafe."}
