wake_watch.line_update_unregistered	{"v":"[wake-watch] update available: anti-hall {newest} is newer (seen via the marketplace clone) but is not registered with the harness and has no cache directory yet (this watcher for {role} {id} stays on {own}). Not exiting; run /anti-hall:update to sync the cache and register it with the harness, then /reload-plugins — this will be re-checked on the next update sync."}
